#~ msgid ""
#~ "Ideal for families, solo travelers, curious locals, and organized groups, "
#~ "this tour is the perfect introduction to Namur. Whether you're here for "
#~ "the history, the views, or just the vibe — <strong>Namur will surprise "
#~ "you, and our bus tour will make sure you don’t miss a thing.</strong>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "هذه الجولة مثالية للعائلات والمسافرين الفرديين والسكان المحليين الفضوليين "
